# The suite's own denominator, 2026-09-21 (owner item 2).
# Rule 27 applies to the suite as much as to any instrument: "25 suites,
# 115 tests, all green" is a numerator with no denominator printed.
#
# Method: whole tree rebuilt with --coverage at -O0, `make test-all` run,
#   then gcov over EVERY .gcda.  A source compiled into several test
#   binaries has several .gcda files; the MAXIMUM per source is taken,
#   because the union of what any run reached is what the suite reaches.
#   Counting only one would understate it; summing would double-count.
# Coverage is LINE coverage.  It says which lines ran, not whether what
#   ran was asserted -- a different and weaker claim than the 127
#   expectations confirmed against a second instrument.

